# MTL file for sphere with white material
newmtl default
Ka 1.000 1.000 1.000  # Ambient color (white)
Kd 1.000 1.000 1.000  # Diffuse color (white)
Ks 0.500 0.500 0.500  # Specular color (medium gray for some shine)
Ns 32.000             # Specular exponent (shininess)
d 1.000               # Opacity (fully opaque)
illum 2               # Illumination model (includes ambient, diffuse and specular) 